# Linear-symmetry SCF in the complex basis, unrestricted meta-GGA with
# spherical p functions; the energy equals erkale's.
System O2.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method mgga_x_tpss-mgga_c_tpss
Multiplicity 3
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
OptLM false
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
ConvThr 1e-8
SaveChk complex_orbs_o2_tpss.chk
